        "h": 4
      },
      "description": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Grafana evaluates real conditions against **VictoriaMetrics** every 30 seconds. Pending conditions must persist for the configured hold time before firing. [Open the full rule list](/grafana/alerting/list). **Notifications are always muted; alert evaluation stays active.** No external delivery is configured. A complete host outage still needs an independent external monitor."
